flowchart TB
  accTitle: The public boundary of DorkOS Cloud
  accDescr: Optional local Cloud clients use HTTPS. Legacy app-side paths coexist with the versioned public contract. The versioned client resolves authenticated instance identity before minting scoped inference credentials under the same current link. A Runs on choice selects credits. Claude Code uses session launch configuration, Codex a separate conversation home, and OpenCode a sidecar-wide local relay. The token served list gates request formats; the environment variable only disables credits. The existing tunnel is a separate route to the local server.
  subgraph app["Open-source app · local machine"]
    local["Local DorkOS server<br/>Runs without a Cloud link"]
    legacy["Cloud link + managed services client<br/>Existing /api/auth and /api/instances calls"]
    versioned["Versioned client<br/>@dork-labs/cloud-api/client"]
    runtime["Runs on: credits + current link<br/>Claude Code: session · Codex: conversation<br/>OpenCode: sidecar via local credits relay<br/>Format gated by token served list"]
    tunnel["Existing tunnel manager<br/>ngrok SDK · optional"]
    local --> legacy
    local --> versioned
    local --> runtime
    local --> tunnel
  end
  control["Configured service origin<br/>DORKOS_CLOUD_URL; defaults to website<br/>Account handover is route-specific"]
  remote["Managed remote command consumer<br/>Draft only · enrollment + ingress gates"]
  remote -.->|"Unwired command SSE + lease/ack"| control
  inference["Inference endpoint<br/>URL + scoped token returned at runtime"]
  contract["Public contract: packages/cloud-api<br/>Schemas + route table + fixtures<br/>Accounts · instances · managed services<br/>entitlements · seats · remote access · inference<br/>Spaces on DorkOS: start / claim / moves"]
  edge["Tunnel service"]
  browser["Remote browser"]
  legacy -->|"HTTPS: device link, heartbeat,<br/>managed actions + event pull/ack"| control
  versioned -->|"HTTPS /v1 · bearer auth<br/>Session identity → inference mint<br/>Same credential / origin / generation"| control
  contract -.->|"Contract describes wire;<br/>not a deployment guarantee"| control
  runtime -->|"Inference protocol over HTTPS<br/>when chosen and available"| inference
  tunnel -->|"Outbound tunnel connection"| edge
  browser -->|"HTTPS / WSS"| edge
  edge -->|"Forward app traffic through tunnel"| local
  community["Space server API · implemented<br/>Scoped keys · limits · usage<br/>The space server owns content and storage"]
  control -.->|"Space-management contract · availability-dependent<br/>HTTPS server API; no database access"| community
